                                                "sense_id": "3400cfe4-172d-3585-ac6b-55c3941c5b2b",
                                                "text": "His early-morning alertness had gradually given way to bad-tempered enervation as the sun went down, and now his legs dragged, his shoulders slumped as he walked, and even from here I could hear his breath wheezing out of his nose."
